    - target: {fileID: 4295273191886776094, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: 2.9899902
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5044895167825690137, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.x
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5044895167825690137, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: -0.17001343
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5852411983675001394, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.x
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5979512402034284591, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.x
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6403682161391571174, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6852845965144907985, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcName
      value: Madam Seza
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6852845965144907985, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSlides.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6852845965144907985, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueSlides.Array.data[0]'
      value: You smell like coin, stranger. Coin and courage. Dangerous mix in these
        parts.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6852845965144907985, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueSlides.Array.data[1]'
      value: "North of here, there's a cave choked with brambles. Locals won\u2019t
        go near it \u2014 say the wind there don\u2019t blow right. Say it sings."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6852845965144907985, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueSlides.Array.data[2]'
      value: "Used to be a chapel once, buried in the stone. Now it's a crypt. Old,
        untouched. Mostly. Some say it was sealed in the old king\u2019s time. Others
        say it sealed itself."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6852845965144907985, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueSlides.Array.data[3]'
      value: "But if you're the sort that don\u2019t mind a bit of dirt on your hands...
        might be something worth dragging out of there. Just don\u2019t bring anything
        back with you, yeah?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6852845965144907985, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueSlides.Array.data[4]'
      value: "You\u2019ll know you\u2019re close when the birds stop singing... and
        the ground starts to hum."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7572536942286001755, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.x
      value: 8.5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7807143899773083376, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.x
      value: 126.31
