      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6852845965144907985, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: isQuest
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6852845965144907985, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcName
      value: Old Man Reza
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6852845965144907985, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: questTitles.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6852845965144907985, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: questRewards.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6852845965144907985, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSlides.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6852845965144907985, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'questTitles.Array.data[0]'
      value: The Filth Below
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6852845965144907985, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'questRewards.Array.data[0]'
      value: Stat. Increase
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6852845965144907985, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueSlides.Array.data[0]'
      value: "Saltmourne's a carcass, friend. The rot runs deep, and I ain\u2019t
        talkin\u2019 about the sea air. Underneath us \u2014 the old bones of the
        town, catacombs turned sewer lines, now crawling with filth. Not just rats
        and runoff... No. The dead don\u2019t stay buried here."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6852845965144907985, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueSlides.Array.data[1]'
      value: "Some say it\u2019s curses. Others \u2014 that the crypts were never
        truly emptied. Whatever it is, it\u2019s keeping folks up at night... those
        who haven\u2019t fled, anyway."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6852845965144907985, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueSlides.Array.data[2]'
      value: "Here's the game. You head down there, clear a path. In the chaos, you
        pick the place clean. Gold. Relics. Maybe even something... older. But mind
        you \u2014 these aren\u2019t just shamblers. Some of \u2018em remember who
        they were. And they hate you for breathing."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6852845965144907985, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueSlides.Array.data[3]'
      value: "So, what\u2019ll it be, Warden? Time to prove you\u2019re more than
        a rat with a sword."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6852845965144907985, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: questDescriptions.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6852845965144907985, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'questDescriptions.Array.data[0]'
      value: Head down into Saltmourne's sewers, there you'll find riches, supposedly.
        The entrance is located to the northeast of The Pale Mare.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7572536942286001755, guid: 9e070335084c39a4f9b5bbcafb705285, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.x
      value: 8.5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
